    {
      "id": "frost_orma_inland_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Every one of them facing inland.” She says it the way you say a thing you have said before and been thanked for leaving alone. “A whale that dies at sea arrives however the water leaves it. These have been *arranged*, or they came ashore under their own arrangement, and I do not know which of those I would rather.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "frost_strand_inland"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "frost_orma_inland_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "frost_orma_inland_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
