      "id": "frost_orma_older_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Cut before the moot kept records.” She nods slowly. “Which is a polite way of saying nobody alive knows who set it, or what they were pointing at, or whether they were pointing at it to find it again or to warn somebody off it.”"
        }
